                <p>Enable changing word list and word length.</p>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="0.2.3" date="2025-01-29">
            <description>
                <p>Improve deleting behavior of letters.</p>
                <p>Fix typo 'Congratulations'.</p>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="0.2.2" date="2025-01-27">
            <description>
                <p>Improve word list.</p>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="0.2.1" date="2025-01-26">
            <description>
                <p>Add toast which explains that words need to be in dictionary.</p>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="0.2.0" date="2025-01-25">
